# Windows batch files MUST keep CRLF line endings. With plain LF, cmd.exe
# reports "'dressing-room.bat' is not recognized as an internal or external
# command" and the launcher simply does not run — which is exactly how it
# was first written, and it took a real debugging pass to spot (2026-08-08).
#
# core.autocrlf is currently true on this machine so a checkout would fix it
# anyway, but that is a per-machine setting and not something to rely on.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
